ing::ApplicationDomain/SameAs/Proxy/Individual/ProxyString else ())"/> <sch:let name="followingAndPreceding" value="$followingAndPrecedingExternalItem union $followingAndPrecedingExternalOwlObject union $followingAndPrecedingProxyString"/> <sch:assert test="not(some $i in $sameAs, $j in $followingAndPreceding satisfies ($i eq $j))"> The attribute SameAs shall be unique. { -entity_name:<sch:value-of select="$entity_name"/> -entity_uid:<sch:value-of select="$uid"/> -rule_name:UR1 -attribute_name:SameAs -attribute_value:<sch:value-of select="$sameAs"/> } </sch:assert> </sch:rule></sch:pattern>
