 CompositeGroupShapeElement  CompositeUnitShapeElement  ContinuousShapeElement  AllAroundShapeElement  AllAroundShapeElementAlongCollectionPlane  BetweenShapeElement  ContactingFeature  Datum  DatumFeature  DatumSystem  DatumSystemWithAssociatedModelCoordinateSystem  DatumTarget  PlacedTarget  TargetCircle  TargetCircularCurve  TargetPoint  TargetRectangle  TargetStraightLine  TargetArea  TargetCurve  DerivedShapeElement  Apex  CentreOfSymmetry  Extension  GeometricAlignment  GeometricContact  GeometricIntersection  ParallelOffset  PerpendicularTo  Tangent  OccurrenceShapeElement  OccurrenceShapeFeature  CrossSectionalOccurrenceShapeElement  OccurrenceContactFeature  OccurrenceTerminal  CableOccurrenceTerminal  CableOccurrenceTerminalLocationGroup  WireOccurrenceTerminal  OccurrenceTransportFeature  WireOccurrenceIdentification  PartShapeElement  AssemblyShapeConstraint  AssemblyShapeJoint  ComponentPathShapeElement  HarnessNode  HarnessSegment  Nominal3dFeature  Nominal3dDerivedFeature  Nominal3dIntegralFeature  Nominal3dEdge  PartConnectivityDefinition  PartFeature  CrossSectionalPartShapeElement  CrossSectionalAlternativePartShapeElement  CrossSectionalGroupShapeElement  CrossSectionalGroupShapeElementWithLacing  CrossSectionalGroupShapeElementWithTubularCover  TwistedCrossSectionalGroupShapeElement  PartContactFeature  PartTerminal  PartTransportFeature  WirePartIdentification  PlaneShapeElement  PointShapeElement  ShapeFeatureDefinitionElement  ShapeFeatureDefinitionOccurrenceElement  ToleranceZone  DirectedOrOrientedToleranceZone  AffectedPlaneToleranceZone  ToleranceZoneWithDatum  DirectedToleranceZone  DirectionFeatureToleranceZone  OrientedToleranceZone ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //ShapeElement[@uid = $uidRef]">(BetweenShapeElement : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The BetweenShapeElement.Components contains a bad reference (<sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>) must be of type ShapeElement.</sch:assert>
      </sch:rule>
   </sch:pattern>
   <!--(Rule specific to Id construct) ShapeElement.Id : OPTIONAL IdentifierSelect-->
   <sch:pattern id="BetweenShapeElement_Id">
      <sch:rule context="//*[@uid and ((self::SubObject and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BetweenShapeElement') or (self::ShapeElement and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BetweenShapeElement'))]/Id">
         <sch:let name="uid" value="../@uid"/>
         <sch:let name="directId" value="@id"/>
         <sch:assert test="(count($directId) != 0 or count(Identifier/@id) != 0) and (count($directId) != 1 or count(Identifier/@id) = 0)">(BetweenShapeElement : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The BetweenShapeElement.Id shall be defined with exactly one of the following construct Id/@id or Identifier/@id.</sch:assert>
      </sch:rule>
   </sch:pattern>
   <!--(Reference to Entity) ShapeElement.ClassifiedAs : OPTIONAL SET[1:unbounded] OF Classification (kind=AGGREGATE - cardinality=OPTIONAL SET[1:unbounded] OF  - redefined=false)-->
   <sch:pattern id="BetweenShapeElement_ClassifiedAs">
      <sch:rule context="//*[@uid and ((self::SubObject and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BetweenShapeElement') or (self::ShapeElement and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BetweenShapeElement'))]/ClassifiedAs/Classification">
         <sch:let name="uid" value="../../@uid"/>
         <sch:let name="uidRef" value="@uidRef"/>
         <sch:assert test="//ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Classification ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))] or //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Classification ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //Classification[@uid = $uidRef]">(BetweenShapeElement : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The BetweenShapeElement.ClassifiedAs contains a bad reference (<sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>) must be of type Classification.</sch:assert>
      </sch:rule>
   </sch:pattern>
   <!--(Reference to Select) ShapeElement.RepresentedGeometry : OPTIONAL ShapeElementRepresentedGeometrySelect (kind=SINGLE - cardinality=OPTIONAL  - redefined=false)-->
   <sch:pattern id="BetweenShapeElement_RepresentedGeometry">
      <sch:rule context="//*[@uid and ((self::SubObject and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BetweenShapeElement') or (self::ShapeElement and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BetweenShapeElement'))]/RepresentedGeometry">
         <sch:let name="uid" value="../@uid"/>
         <sch:let name="uidRef" value="@uidRef"/>
         <sch:assert test="//ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' DetailedGeometricModelItem  AdvancedFace  AxisPlacement  ToolAttachmentPointFrame  ToolCentrePointFrame  CameraModel3D  Cartesian11  ClippingOperator  ConnectedFaceSet  Curve  BoundedCurve  BoundedCurveWithLength  CompositeCurveOnSurface  Pcurve  SurfaceCurve  TrimmedCurve  Curve11  Cylindrical11  Direction  EdgeLoop  GeometricPlaceholderSet  GeometricSet  GeometricCurveSet  BoundaryCurveSet  InterpolatedConfigurationSequence  KinematicPair  HighOrderKinematicPair  LowOrderKinematicPair  LowOrderKinematicPairWithMotionCoupling  KinematicPairValue  KinematicPairWithMotionCoupling  KinematicPathDefinedByNodes  LightSource  Loop  PlanarBox  Point  CartesianPoint  LeaderLinePoint  LeaderLinePointWithSurface  DegeneratePcurve  PointOnCurve  PointOnSurface  PointAndVector  PointArray  Polar11  RotationAboutDirection  Surface  OrientedSurface  Plane  RectangularTrimmedSurface  TessellatedItem ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))] or //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Curve  BoundedCurve  BoundedCurveWithLength  CompositeCurveOnSurface  Pcurve  SurfaceCurve  TrimmedCurve ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))] or //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Point  CartesianPoint  LeaderLinePoint  LeaderLinePointWithSurface  DegeneratePcurve  PointOnCurve  PointOnSurface ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))] or //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Surface  OrientedSurface  Plane  RectangularTrimmedSurface ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))] or //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' AdvancedFace ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))] or //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' ConnectedFaceSet ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))] or //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' EdgeCurve  EdgeBoundedCurveWithLength ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))] or //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' EdgeLoop ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))] or //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' VertexPoint ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))] or //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' TopologicalRepresentationItem  ConnectedEdgeSet  ConnectedEdgeSubSet  Edge  EdgeCurve  EdgeBoundedCurveWithLength  SubEdge  FaceSurface  Path  Vertex  VertexPoint ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))] or //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' DetailedGeometricModelItem  AdvancedFace  AxisPlacement  ToolAttachmentPointFrame  ToolCentrePointFrame  CameraModel3D  Cartesian11  ClippingOperator  ConnectedFaceSet  Curve  BoundedCurve  BoundedCurveWithLength  CompositeCurveOnSurface  Pcurve  SurfaceCurve  TrimmedCurve  Curve11  Cylindrical11  Direction  EdgeLoop  GeometricPlaceholderSet  GeometricSet  GeometricCurveSet  BoundaryCurveSet  InterpolatedConfigurationSequence  KinematicPair  HighOrderKinematicPair  LowOrderKinematicPair  LowOrderKinematicPairWithMotionCoupling  KinematicPairValue  KinematicPairWithMotionCoupling  KinematicPathDefinedByNodes  LightSource  Loop  PlanarBox  Point  CartesianPoint  LeaderLinePoint  LeaderLinePointWithSurface  DegeneratePcurve  PointOnCurve  PointOnSurface  PointAndVector  PointArray  Polar11  RotationAboutDirection  Surface  OrientedSurface  Plane  RectangularTrimmedSurface  TessellatedItem ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Curve  BoundedCurve  BoundedCurveWithLength  CompositeCurveOnSurface  Pcurve  SurfaceCurve  TrimmedCurve ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Point  CartesianPoint  LeaderLinePoint  LeaderLinePointWithSurface  DegeneratePcurve  PointOnCurve  PointOnSurface ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Surface  OrientedSurface  Plane  RectangularTrimmedSurface ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' AdvancedFace ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' ConnectedFaceSet ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' EdgeCurve  EdgeBoundedCurveWithLength ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' EdgeLoop ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' VertexPoint ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' TopologicalRepresentationItem  ConnectedEdgeSet  ConnectedEdgeSubSet  Edge  EdgeCurve  EdgeBoundedCurveWithLength  SubEdge  FaceSurface  Path  Vertex  VertexPoint ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //RepresentationItem[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' DetailedGeometricModelItem  AdvancedFace  AxisPlacement  ToolAttachmentPointFrame  ToolCentrePointFrame  CameraModel3D  Cartesian11  ClippingOperator  ConnectedFaceSet  Curve  BoundedCurve  BoundedCurveWithLength  CompositeCurveOnSurface  Pcurve  SurfaceCurve  TrimmedCurve  Curve11  Cylindrical11  Direction  EdgeLoop  GeometricPlaceholderSet  GeometricSet  GeometricCurveSet  BoundaryCurveSet  InterpolatedConfigurationSequence  KinematicPair  HighOrderKinematicPair  LowOrderKinematicPair  LowOrderKinematicPairWithMotionCoupling  KinematicPairValue  KinematicPairWithMotionCoupling  KinematicPathDefinedByNodes  LightSource  Loop  PlanarBox  Point  CartesianPoint  LeaderLinePoint  LeaderLinePointWithSurface  DegeneratePcurve  PointOnCurve  PointOnSurface  PointAndVector  PointArray  Polar11  RotationAboutDirection  Surface  OrientedSurface  Plane  RectangularTrimmedSurface  TessellatedItem ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //RepresentationItem[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Curve  BoundedCurve  BoundedCurveWithLength  CompositeCurveOnSurface  Pcurve  SurfaceCurve  TrimmedCurve ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //RepresentationItem[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Point  CartesianPoint  LeaderLinePoint  LeaderLinePointWithSurface  DegeneratePcurve  PointOnCurve  PointOnSurface ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //RepresentationItem[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Surface  OrientedSurface  Plane  RectangularTrimmedSurface ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //RepresentationItem[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' AdvancedFace ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //RepresentationItem[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' ConnectedFaceSet ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //RepresentationItem[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' EdgeCurve  EdgeBoundedCurveWithLength ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //RepresentationItem[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' EdgeLoop ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //RepresentationItem[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' VertexPoint ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //RepresentationItem[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' TopologicalRepresentationItem  ConnectedEdgeSet  ConnectedEdgeSubSet  Edge  EdgeCurve  EdgeBoundedCurveWithLength  SubEdge  FaceSurface  Path  Vertex  VertexPoint ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]">(BetweenShapeElement : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The BetweenShapeElement.RepresentedGeometry contains a bad reference (<sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>) must be an element of ShapeElementRepresentedGeometrySelect.</sch:assert>
      </sch:rule>
   </sch:pattern>
   <!--(Rule BetweenShapeElement.WR2)-->
   <sch:pattern id="BetweenShapeElement_WR2"><sch:rule context="//ShapeElement/EndFeatures/ShapeElement"> <sch:let name="uidRef" value="@uidRef"/> <sch:let name="uid" value="../../@uid"/> <sch:assert test=" //ShapeElement[@uid=$uidRef]/ProductDefinitional='true'"> (BetweenShapeElement <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) all EndFeatures shall be definitional <sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>=<sch:value-of select="//ShapeElement[@uid=$uidRef]/ProductDefinitional"/>. </sch:assert> </sch:rule></sch:pattern>
   <!--(Rule BetweenShapeElement.WR1)-->
   <sch:pattern id="BetweenShapeElement_WR1"><sch:rule context="//ShapeElement/StartFeatures/ShapeElement"> <sch:let name="uidRef" value="@uidRef"/> <sch:let name="uid" value="../../@uid"/> <sch:assert test=" //ShapeElement[@uid=$uidRef]/ProductDefinitional='true'"> (BetweenShapeElement <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) all StartFeatures shall be definitional <sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>=<sch:value-of select="//ShapeElement[@uid=$uidRef]/ProductDefinitional"/>. </sch:assert> </sch:rule></sch:pattern>
   <!--- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -->
   <!--BeveledSheetRepresentation set of rules-->
   <!--(Reference to Entity) BeveledSheetRepresentation.BoundarySurface : CompositeSheetRepresentation (kind=SINGLE - cardinality= - redefined=false)-->
   <sch:pattern id="BeveledSheetRepresentation_BoundarySurface">
      <sch:rule context="//*[@uid and ((self::SubObject and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BeveledSheetRepresentation') or (self::Representation and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BeveledSheetRepresentation'))]/BoundarySurface">
         <sch:let name="uid" value="../@uid"/>
         <sch:let name="uidRef" value="@uidRef"/>
         <sch:assert test="//ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' CompositeSheetRepresentation  FaceBasedSheetRepresentation  GeometricSheetRepresentation ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))] or //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' CompositeSheetRepresentation  FaceBasedSheetRepresentation  GeometricSheetRepresentation ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //Representation[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' CompositeSheetRepresentation  FaceBasedSheetRepresentation  GeometricSheetRepresentation ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]">(BeveledSheetRepresentation : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The BeveledSheetRepresentation.BoundarySurface contains a bad reference (<sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>) must be of type CompositeSheetRepresentation.</sch:assert>
      </sch:rule>
   </sch:pattern>
   <!--(Inverse of GeometricCoordinateSpace.Representations :: PartProperty) GeometricRepresentation.ContextOfItems : GeometricCoordinateSpace => no rule needed when PartProperty or Optional-->
   <!--(Rule specific to Id construct) Representation.Id : IdentifierSelect-->
   <sch:pattern id="BeveledSheetRepresentation_Id">
      <sch:rule context="//*[@uid and ((self::SubObject and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BeveledSheetRepresentation') or (self::Representation and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BeveledSheetRepresentation'))]/Id">
         <sch:let name="uid" value="../@uid"/>
         <sch:let name="directId" value="@id"/>
         <sch:assert test="(count($directId) != 0 or count(Identifier/@id) != 0) and (count($directId) != 1 or count(Identifier/@id) = 0)">(BeveledSheetRepresentation : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The BeveledSheetRepresentation.Id shall be defined with exactly one of the following construct Id/@id or Identifier/@id.</sch:assert>
      </sch:rule>
   </sch:pattern>
   <!--(Rule specific to Id construct) Representation.VersionId : OPTIONAL IdentifierSelect-->
   <sch:pattern id="BeveledSheetRepresentation_VersionId">
      <sch:rule context="//*[@uid and ((self::SubObject and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BeveledSheetRepresentation') or (self::Representation and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BeveledSheetRepresentation'))]/VersionId">
         <sch:let name="uid" value="../@uid"/>
         <sch:let name="directId" value="@id"/>
         <sch:assert test="(count($directId) != 0 or count(Identifier/@id) != 0) and (count($directId) != 1 or count(Identifier/@id) = 0)">(BeveledSheetRepresentation : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The BeveledSheetRepresentation.VersionId shall be defined with exactly one of the following construct Id/@id or Identifier/@id.</sch:assert>
      </sch:rule>
   </sch:pattern>
   <!--(Reference to Entity) Representation.ClassifiedAs : OPTIONAL SET[1:unbounded] OF Classification (kind=AGGREGATE - cardinality=OPTIONAL SET[1:unbounded] OF  - redefined=false)-->
   <sch:pattern id="BeveledSheetRepresentation_ClassifiedAs">
      <sch:rule context="//*[@uid and ((self::SubObject and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BeveledSheetRepresentation') or (self::Representation and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BeveledSheetRepresentation'))]/ClassifiedAs/Classification">
         <sch:let name="uid" value="../../@uid"/>
         <sch:let name="uidRef" value="@uidRef"/>
         <sch:assert test="//ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Classification ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))] or //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Classification ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //Classification[@uid = $uidRef]">(BeveledSheetRepresentation : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The BeveledSheetRepresentation.ClassifiedAs contains a bad reference (<sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>) must be of type Classification.</sch:assert>
      </sch:rule>
   </sch:pattern>
   <!--(Reference to Entity) Representation.Items : SET[1:unbounded] OF RepresentationItem (kind=AGGREGATE - cardinality=SET[1:unbounded] OF  - redefined=false)-->
   <sch:pattern id="BeveledSheetRepresentation_Items">
      <sch:rule context="//*[@uid and ((self::SubObject and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BeveledSheetRepresentation') or (self::Representation and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BeveledSheetRepresentation'))]/Items/RepresentationItem">
         <sch:let name="uid" value="../../@uid"/>
         <sch:let name="uidRef" value="@uidRef"/>
         <sch:assert test="//ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' RepresentationItem  Callout  DetailedGeometricModelItem  AdvancedFace  AxisPlacement  ToolAttachmentPointFrame  ToolCentrePointFrame  CameraModel3D  Cartesian11  ClippingOperator  ConnectedFaceSet  Curve  BoundedCurve  BoundedCurveWithLength  CompositeCurveOnSurface  Pcurve  SurfaceCurve  TrimmedCurve  Curve11  Cylindrical11  Direction  EdgeLoop  GeometricPlaceholderSet  GeometricSet  GeometricCurveSet  BoundaryCurveSet  InterpolatedConfigurationSequence  KinematicPair  HighOrderKinematicPair  LowOrderKinematicPair  LowOrderKinematicPairWithMotionCoupling  KinematicPairValue  KinematicPairWithMotionCoupling  KinematicPathDefinedByNodes  LightSource  Loop  PlanarBox  Point  CartesianPoint  LeaderLinePoint  LeaderLinePointWithSurface  DegeneratePcurve  PointOnCurve  PointOnSurface  PointAndVector  PointArray  Polar11  RotationAboutDirection  Surface  OrientedSurface  Plane  RectangularTrimmedSurface  TessellatedItem  ExternalRepresentationItem  ExternalTessellatedAnnotation  StyledElement  AnnotationElement  AnnotationPlaceholderOccurrence  AnnotationPlane  TessellatedAnnotation  OverRidingStyledElement  ContextDependentOverRidingStyledElement  StyledModelReplication  TopologicalRepresentationItem  ConnectedEdgeSet  ConnectedEdgeSubSet  Edge  EdgeCurve  EdgeBoundedCurveWithLength  SubEdge  FaceSurface  Path  Vertex  VertexPoint  UserDefined11 ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))] or //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' RepresentationItem  Callout  DetailedGeometricModelItem  AdvancedFace  AxisPlacement  ToolAttachmentPointFrame  ToolCentrePointFrame  CameraModel3D  Cartesian11  ClippingOperator  ConnectedFaceSet  Curve  BoundedCurve  BoundedCurveWithLength  CompositeCurveOnSurface  Pcurve  SurfaceCurve  TrimmedCurve  Curve11  Cylindrical11  Direction  EdgeLoop  GeometricPlaceholderSet  GeometricSet  GeometricCurveSet  BoundaryCurveSet  InterpolatedConfigurationSequence  KinematicPair  HighOrderKinematicPair  LowOrderKinematicPair  LowOrderKinematicPairWithMotionCoupling  KinematicPairValue  KinematicPairWithMotionCoupling  KinematicPathDefinedByNodes  LightSource  Loop  PlanarBox  Point  CartesianPoint  LeaderLinePoint  LeaderLinePointWithSurface  DegeneratePcurve  PointOnCurve  PointOnSurface  PointAndVector  PointArray  Polar11  RotationAboutDirection  Surface  OrientedSurface  Plane  RectangularTrimmedSurface  TessellatedItem  ExternalRepresentationItem  ExternalTessellatedAnnotation  StyledElement  AnnotationElement  AnnotationPlaceholderOccurrence  AnnotationPlane  TessellatedAnnotation  OverRidingStyledElement  ContextDependentOverRidingStyledElement  StyledModelReplication  TopologicalRepresentationItem  ConnectedEdgeSet  ConnectedEdgeSubSet  Edge  EdgeCurve  EdgeBoundedCurveWithLength  SubEdge  FaceSurface  Path  Vertex  VertexPoint  UserDefined11 ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //RepresentationItem[@uid = $uidRef]">(BeveledSheetRepresentation : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The BeveledSheetRepresentation.Items contains a bad reference (<sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>) must be of type RepresentationItem.</sch:assert>
      </sch:rule>
   </sch:pattern>
   <!--(Reference to Select) Representation.RepresentationTypes : OPTIONAL SET[1:unbounded] OF ClassSelect (kind=AGGREGATE - cardinality=OPTIONAL SET[1:unbounded] OF  - redefined=false)-->
   <sch:pattern id="BeveledSheetRepresentation_RepresentationTypes">
      <sch:rule context="//*[@uid and ((self::SubObject and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BeveledSheetRepresentation') or (self::Representation and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BeveledSheetRepresentation'))]/RepresentationTypes/*">
         <sch:let name="uid" value="../../@uid"/>
         <sch:let name="uidRef" value="@uidRef"/>
         <sch:assert test="(self::Class and //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Class ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))]) or (self::ExternalOwlClass and //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' ExternalOwlClass ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))]) or (self::Class and //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Class ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::ExternalOwlClass and //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' ExternalOwlClass ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::Class and //Class[@uid = $uidRef]) or (self::ClassString) or (self::ExternalOwlClass and //ExternalOwlClass[@uid = $uidRef])">(BeveledSheetRepresentation : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The BeveledSheetRepresentation.RepresentationTypes contains a bad reference (<sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>) must be an element of ClassSelect.</sch:assert>
      </sch:rule>
   </sch:pattern>
   <!--(Inverse of RepresentationContext.Representations :: PartProperty) Representation.ContextOfItems : RepresentationContext => no rule needed when PartProperty or Optional-->
   <!--(Rule BeveledSheetRepresentation.WR1)-->
   <sch:pattern id="BeveledSheetRepresentation_WR1"><sch:rule context="//Representation[@uid and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BeveledSheetRepresentation']"> <sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/> <sch:let name="BevelAngleuidRef" value="BevelAngle/Unit/@uidRef"/> <sch:let name="VerticalProfileHeightRef" value="VerticalProfileHeight/Unit/@uidRef"/> <sch:assert test="(//Unit[@uid=$BevelAngleuidRef]/Quantity/ClassString ='angle') and (//Unit[@uid=$VerticalProfileHeightRef]/Quantity/ClassString ='length')">(BeveledSheetRepresentation.WR1 <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) the unit name for BevelAngle shall be 'angle', the unit name for VerticalProfileHeight shall be 'length'.</sch:assert> </sch:rule></sch:pattern>
   <!--- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -->
   <!--BooleanValue set of rules-->
   <!--(Reference to Entity) PropertyValue.ClassifiedAs : OPTIONAL SET[1:unbounded] OF Classification (kind=AGGREGATE - cardinality=OPTIONAL SET[1:unbounded] OF  - redefined=false)-->
   <sch:pattern id="BooleanValue_ClassifiedAs">
      <sch:rule context="//*[@uid and ((self::SubObject and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BooleanValue') or (self::PropertyValue and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BooleanValue'))]/ClassifiedAs/Classification">
         <sch:let name="uid" value="../../@uid"/>
         <sch:let name="uidRef" value="@uidRef"/>
         <sch:assert test="//ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Classification ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))] or //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Classification ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //Classification[@uid = $uidRef]">(BooleanValue : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The BooleanValue.ClassifiedAs contains a bad reference (<sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>) must be of type Classification.</sch:assert>
      </sch:rule>
   </sch:pattern>
   <!--(Reference to Select) PropertyValue.Definition : OPTIONAL PropertyDefinitionSelect (kind=AGGREGATE - cardinality=OPTIONAL  - redefined=false)-->
   <sch:pattern id="BooleanValue_Definition">
      <sch:rule context="//*[@uid and ((self::SubObject and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BooleanValue') or (self::PropertyValue and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BooleanValue'))]/Definition/*">
         <sch:let name="uid" value="../../@uid"/>
         <sch:let name="uidRef" value="@uidRef"/>
         <sch:assert test="(self::PropertyDefinition and //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' PropertyDefinition  MaterialPropertyDefinition  WireColourBasedIdentificationCode ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))]) or (self::PropertyDefinition and //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' PropertyDefinition  MaterialPropertyDefinition  WireColourBasedIdentificationCode ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::PropertyDefinition and //PropertyDefinition[@uid = $uidRef]) or (self::PropertyDefinitionEnum) or (self::PropertyDefinitionString)">(BooleanValue : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The BooleanValue.Definition contains a bad reference (<sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>) must be an element of PropertyDefinitionSelect.</sch:assert>
      </sch:rule>
   </sch:pattern>
   <!--(Reference to Select) PropertyValue.DeterminationMethod : OPTIONAL ClassSelect (kind=AGGREGATE - cardinality=OPTIONAL  - redefined=false)-->
   <sch:pattern id="BooleanValue_DeterminationMethod">
      <sch:rule context="//*[@uid and ((self::SubObject and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BooleanValue') or (self::PropertyValue and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BooleanValue'))]/DeterminationMethod/*">
         <sch:let name="uid" value="../../@uid"/>
         <sch:let name="uidRef" value="@uidRef"/>
         <sch:assert test="(self::Class and //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Class ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))]) or (self::ExternalOwlClass and //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' ExternalOwlClass ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))]) or (self::Class and //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Class ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::ExternalOwlClass and //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' ExternalOwlClass ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::Class and //Class[@uid = $uidRef]) or (self::ClassString) or (self::ExternalOwlClass and //ExternalOwlClass[@uid = $uidRef])">(BooleanValue : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The BooleanValue.DeterminationMethod contains a bad reference (<sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>) must be an element of ClassSelect.</sch:assert>
      </sch:rule>
   </sch:pattern>
   <!--(Reference to Select) PropertyValue.Qualifiers : OPTIONAL SET[1:unbounded] OF ValueQualifierSelect (kind=AGGREGATE - cardinality=OPTIONAL SET[1:unbounded] OF  - redefined=false)-->
   <sch:pattern id="BooleanValue_Qualifiers">
      <sch:rule context="//*[@uid and ((self::SubObject and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BooleanValue') or (self::PropertyValue and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='BooleanValue'))]/Qualifiers/*">
         <sch:let name="uid" value="../../@uid"/>
         <sch:let name="uidRef" value="@uidRef"/>
         <sch:assert test="(self::PrecisionQualifier and //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' PrecisionQualifier ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))]) or (self::ExternalTypeQualifier and //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' ExternalTypeQualifier ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))]) or (self::PreDefinedTypeQualifier and //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' PreDefinedTypeQualifier ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))]) or (self::UncertaintyQualifier and //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' UncertaintyQualifier  QualitativeUncertainty  StandardUncertainty  ExpandedUncertainty ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))]) or (self::ValueFormatTypeQualifier and //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' ValueFormatTypeQualifier ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))]) or (self::PrecisionQualifier and //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' PrecisionQualifier ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::ExternalTypeQualifier and //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' ExternalTypeQualifier ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::PreDefinedTypeQualifier and //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' PreDefinedTypeQualifier ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::UncertaintyQualifier and //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' UncertaintyQualifier  QualitativeUncertainty  StandardUncertainty  ExpandedUncertainty ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::ValueFormatTypeQualifier and //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' ValueFormatTypeQualifier ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::PrecisionQualifier and //PrecisionQualifier[@uid = $uidRef]) or (self::ExternalTypeQualifier and //ExternalTypeQualifier[@uid = $uidRef]) or (self::PreDefinedTypeQualifier and //PreDefinedTypeQualifier[@uid = $uidRef]) or (self::UncertaintyQualifier and //UncertaintyQualifier[@uid = $uidRef]) or (self::ValueFormatTypeQualifier and //ValueFormatTypeQualifier[@uid = $uidRef])">(BooleanValue : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The BooleanValue.Qualifiers contains a bad reference (<sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>) must be an element of ValueQualifierSelect.</sch:assert>
      </sch:rule>
   </sch:pattern>
   <!--- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -->
   <!--BoundaryCurveSet set of rules-->
   <!--(Reference to Entity) BoundaryCurveSet.Bounds : SET[1:unbounded] OF Curve (kind=AGGREGATE - cardinality=SET[1:unbounded] OF  - redefined=GeometricCurveSet.Elements)-->
   <sch:pattern id="BoundaryCurveSet_Bounds">
