         <sch:assert test="(self::DigitalFile and //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' DigitalFile ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))]) or (self::Document and //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Document ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))]) or (self::Identifier and //ExternalRefBaseObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Identifier ',concat(' ',@typeRef,' '))]) or (self::DigitalFile and //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' DigitalFile ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::Document and //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Document ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::Identifier and //SubObject[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' Identifier ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::DigitalFile and //File[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' DigitalFile ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::Document and //Document[@uid = $uidRef]) or (self::IdentifierSet) or (self::Identifier) or (self::IdentifierString)">(Class : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The Class.Source contains a bad reference (<sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>) must be an element of ExternalSourceSelect.</sch:assert>
      </sch:rule>
   </sch:pattern>
   <!--(Rule Class.UR1)-->
   <sch:pattern id="Class_UR1"> <sch:rule context="//Class[@uid]"> <sch:let name="entity_name" value="if(@xsi:type) then substring-after(@xsi:type,':') else name()"/> <sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/> <sch:let name="ids" value="child::Id/@id union child::Id/descendant::*[self::Identifier]/@id"/> <sch:let name="followingAndPrecedingIds" value="following-sibling::Class/Id/@id union following-sibling::Class/Id/descendant::*[self::Identifier]/@id union preceding-sibling::Class/Id/@id union preceding-sibling::Class/Id/descendant::*[self::Identifier]/@id"/> <sch:assert test="count($ids) = 0 or not(some $i in $ids, $j in $followingAndPrecedingIds satisfies ($i eq $j))"> The Id shall be unique. { -entity_name:<sch:value-of select="$entity_name"/> -entity_uid:<sch:value-of select="$uid"/> -rule_name:UR1 -attribute_name:Id -attribute_value:<sch:value-of select="$ids"/> } </sch:assert> </sch:rule></sch:pattern>
   <!--- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -->
