         <sch:let name="uid" value="../@uid"/>
         <sch:let name="directId" value="@id"/>
         <sch:assert test="(count($directId) != 0 or count(Identifier/@id) != 0) and (count($directId) != 1 or count(Identifier/@id) = 0)">(ComposedGeometricModel : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The ComposedGeometricModel.VersionId shall be defined with exactly one of the following construct Id/@id or Identifier/@id.</sch:assert>
