   <!--(Reference to Entity) EvaluatedRequirement.ClassifiedAs : OPTIONAL SET[1:unbounded] OF Classification (kind=AGGREGATE - cardinality=OPTIONAL SET[1:unbounded] OF  - redefined=false)-->
