xternalTessellatedShapeRepresentation  TransformedGeometricModel  InterpolatedConfigurationModel  KinematicLink  LinkMotionAlongPath  Mechanism  MechanismState  StyledModel  AnnotatedModelPresentation  ExternalStyledModel  PlyAngleRepresentation  ReinforcementOrientationBasis ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))] or //Representation[@uid = $uidRef]">(GeometryToTopologyModelAssociation : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The GeometryToTopologyModelAssociation.Related contains a bad reference (<sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>) must be of type Representation.</sch:assert>
