odel ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]">(QuantifiedOccurrence : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The QuantifiedOccurrence.AuxiliaryGeometry contains a bad reference (<sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>) must be of type GeometricModel.</sch:assert>
