endicularityTolerance  PositionTolerance  RoundnessTolerance  StraightnessTolerance  SurfaceProfileTolerance  SymmetryTolerance  TotalRunoutTolerance ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::DimensionalLocation and //GeometricDimension[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' DimensionalLocation  AngularLocation  CurvedDistance  LinearDistance ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::DimensionalSize and //GeometricDimension[@uid = $uidRef and contains(' DimensionalSize  AngularSize  CurvedSize  DiameterSize  EdgeOfUndefinedShapeSize  RadialSize  ThicknessSize ',concat(' ',substring-after(@xsi:type,':'),' '))]) or (self::GeneralDatumReference and //GeneralDatumReference[@uid = $uidRef]) or (self::GeometricTolerance and //GeometricTolerance[@uid = $uidRef])">(ToleranceZone : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The ToleranceZone.ZoneFor contains a bad reference (<sch:value-of select="$uidRef"/>) must be an element of ToleranceZoneTargetSelect.</sch:assert>
