         <sch:assert test="count(AssociatedTransportFeature) = 1">(WireOccurrenceTerminal : <sch:value-of select="$uid"/>) The WireOccurrenceTerminal.AssociatedTransportFeature attribute cardinality is redefined as [1].</sch:assert>
